<p>A few things bothered me about this.</p>
<ol>
<li>Just because the Foundation operatives are posing as the local police and fire department does not mean that the local police and fire department are not going to show up.</li>
<li>Wouldn't the Foundation operatives feel his as strong a compulsion to enter SCP-247 as the civilians?</li>
<li>Where the hell did that digestive tract come from? Are you implying that the structure extends itself into the ground, and if so, how? In fact, why would it need a digestive system? What does it use the energy for and where do the wastes go?</li>
